 "final_passage": "Wrenfold outperformed Fennick-Base on the unseen test set from the training domains (Banking: 93.1% vs 91.6%; Travel: 92.4% vs 90.9% macro-F1). This advantage also held across all three held-out domains, with Wrenfold achieving higher macro-F1 than Fennick-Base on Insurance (85.7% vs 81.2%), Telecom (83.9% vs 80.4%), and Utilities (86.2% vs 82.0%). However, no statistical tests were reported, so the reliability of these differences is not established.",
